'''Infected''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by redeeming the [[codes|code]] "INF3CT3D".  It is now only obtainable through trading as the promo code has since expired. 

==Appearance==
Infected is referenced off of a zombie, hence the name. The tip of the blade has a brain texture, while the rest of the blade is covered in a zombie green with two brown scratch marks. It also has a silver guard, and a solid black handle.

